# DME101.030 — Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator — cases (Stage 1 CEL, DECOMPOSED)
library "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Cases".
covers "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage".

/*
============================ Companion CEL (DECOMPOSED) ============================
Companion to the DECOMPOSED dme-101-030-medical-policy.crl. The approval case
asserts the six NOTE-1 LEAVES; run_decision evaluates the `defined as` composite
(#126, landed) and approves. The six drop-one-leaf cases prove each NOTE-1 element
is NECESSARY — each denies because the one missing leaf breaks the `sem-and` (the
run_decision composition trace shows the single false operand). Verify loop GREEN:
run_decision 12/12.
===================================================================================

Leaf coverage of the decision: 4 `when` branches + `otherwise`. The approval leaf
is exercised through the full NOTE-1 composition (all six elements), and each
element is proven necessary by a drop-one-leaf case.
*/

// ============ Patient ============

fact "Sample Patient":
- name is "Sample Patient".
- birth date is "1965-04-12".
- defined by "Patient".

// ============ NOTE-1 documentation leaves ============

fact "Nonunion Exists Finding":
- code is "http://example.org/hcsc/dme101-030|nonunion-exists".
- date is "2026-01-15".
- defined by "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage"."Nonunion Exists".

fact "Two Sets Finding":
- code is "http://example.org/hcsc/dme101-030|at-least-two-radiograph-sets".
- date is "2026-01-15".
- defined by "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage"."At Least Two Radiograph Sets".

fact "Prior To Treatment Finding":
- code is "http://example.org/hcsc/dme101-030|radiographs-prior-to-treatment".
- date is "2026-01-15".
- defined by "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage"."Radiographs Obtained Prior To Treatment".

fact "Ninety Days Apart Finding":
- code is "http://example.org/hcsc/dme101-030|radiograph-sets-at-least-ninety-days-apart".
- date is "2026-01-15".
- defined by "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage"."Radiograph Sets At Least Ninety Days Apart".

fact "Multiple Views Finding":
- code is "http://example.org/hcsc/dme101-030|multiple-views-per-radiograph-set".
- date is "2026-01-15".
- defined by "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage"."Multiple Views Per Radiograph Set".

fact "No Healing Finding":
- code is "http://example.org/hcsc/dme101-030|no-interval-healing-attested".
- date is "2026-01-15".
- defined by "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage"."No Clinically Significant Interval Healing".

// ============ Exclusion facts ============

fact "Concurrent Stimulator Device":
- code is "http://example.org/hcsc/dme101-030|concurrent-noninvasive-stimulator".
- date is "2026-01-15".
- defined by "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage"."Concurrent Noninvasive Stimulator".

fact "Skull Or Vertebral Fracture Finding":
- code is "http://example.org/hcsc/dme101-030|skull-or-vertebral-fracture".
- date is "2026-01-15".
- defined by "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage"."Skull Or Vertebral Fracture".

fact "Tumor Related Fracture Finding":
- code is "http://example.org/hcsc/dme101-030|tumor-related-fracture".
- date is "2026-01-15".
- defined by "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage"."Tumor Related Fracture".

// ============ Approval (full NOTE-1 composition) ============

case "documented nonunion (all six NOTE-1 elements), no exclusion -> approved":
- description is `All six NOTE-1 documentation elements are asserted and no
  exclusion applies, so the composed "Documented Nonunion" sem-and is
  satisfied (run_decision evaluates the composition, #126) and coverage is
  approved.`.
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Nonunion Exists Finding".
- fact is "Two Sets Finding".
- fact is "Prior To Treatment Finding".
- fact is "Ninety Days Apart Finding".
- fact is "Multiple Views Finding".
- fact is "No Healing Finding".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Determination" is "Approve".

// ============ Drop-one-leaf necessity proofs (meaningful post-#126) ============

case "missing: nonunion exists -> denied":
- description is `Five of six NOTE-1 elements present, "Nonunion Exists" absent:
  the composition is not satisfied, so the determination denies.`.
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Two Sets Finding".
- fact is "Prior To Treatment Finding".
- fact is "Ninety Days Apart Finding".
- fact is "Multiple Views Finding".
- fact is "No Healing Finding".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Determination" is "Deny".

case "missing: at least two radiograph sets -> denied":
- description is `"At Least Two Radiograph Sets" absent; the documentation
  standard is not met, so the determination denies.`.
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Nonunion Exists Finding".
- fact is "Prior To Treatment Finding".
- fact is "Ninety Days Apart Finding".
- fact is "Multiple Views Finding".
- fact is "No Healing Finding".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Determination" is "Deny".

case "missing: radiographs prior to treatment -> denied":
- description is `"Radiographs Obtained Prior To Treatment" absent; denies.`.
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Nonunion Exists Finding".
- fact is "Two Sets Finding".
- fact is "Ninety Days Apart Finding".
- fact is "Multiple Views Finding".
- fact is "No Healing Finding".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Determination" is "Deny".

case "missing: ninety days apart -> denied":
- description is `"Radiograph Sets At Least Ninety Days Apart" absent; denies.`.
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Nonunion Exists Finding".
- fact is "Two Sets Finding".
- fact is "Prior To Treatment Finding".
- fact is "Multiple Views Finding".
- fact is "No Healing Finding".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Determination" is "Deny".

case "missing: multiple views per set -> denied":
- description is `"Multiple Views Per Radiograph Set" absent; denies.`.
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Nonunion Exists Finding".
- fact is "Two Sets Finding".
- fact is "Prior To Treatment Finding".
- fact is "Ninety Days Apart Finding".
- fact is "No Healing Finding".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Determination" is "Deny".

case "missing: no interval healing attestation -> denied":
- description is `"No Clinically Significant Interval Healing" absent; denies.`.
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Nonunion Exists Finding".
- fact is "Two Sets Finding".
- fact is "Prior To Treatment Finding".
- fact is "Ninety Days Apart Finding".
- fact is "Multiple Views Finding".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Determination" is "Deny".

// ============ Exclusion + precedence + otherwise leaves ============

case "concurrent noninvasive stimulator -> denied":
- description is `Use with another noninvasive osteogenesis stimulator denies via
  the first exclusion branch, even with full documentation present.`.
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Nonunion Exists Finding".
- fact is "Two Sets Finding".
- fact is "Prior To Treatment Finding".
- fact is "Ninety Days Apart Finding".
- fact is "Multiple Views Finding".
- fact is "No Healing Finding".
- fact is "Concurrent Stimulator Device".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Determination" is "Deny".

case "skull or vertebral fracture -> denied":
- description is `A fracture of the skull or vertebrae is excluded; denies.`.
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Skull Or Vertebral Fracture Finding".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Determination" is "Deny".

case "tumor related fracture -> denied":
- description is `A tumor-related fracture is excluded; denies.`.
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Tumor Related Fracture Finding".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Determination" is "Deny".

case "exclusion overrides full documentation -> denied (ordered precedence)":
- description is `A tumor-related fracture co-occurs with full NOTE-1
  documentation. By ordered precedence the exclusion precedes the approval
  branch, so the determination denies.`.
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Nonunion Exists Finding".
- fact is "Two Sets Finding".
- fact is "Prior To Treatment Finding".
- fact is "Ninety Days Apart Finding".
- fact is "Multiple Views Finding".
- fact is "No Healing Finding".
- fact is "Tumor Related Fracture Finding".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Determination" is "Deny".

case "no qualifying criteria asserted -> denied (otherwise)":
- description is `No documentation element and no exclusion is asserted; the
  otherwise leaf denies (e.g. a fresh fracture / delayed union — absence of a
  documented nonunion).`.
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage Determination" is "Deny".
